  "answer": "Completed. Diagnosis, fix, tests, redeploy and report are all done and verified against the live stack.\n\n**Diagnosis (before editing):** Reproduced in the browser: `POST /api/checkout?currencyCode=USD` → unhandled 500, user stuck on `/cart` with no error. Jaeger trace `fdf93287fae8fdf5c7f0d667b5ddf60c` (via `/grafana/api/datasources/proxy/uid/webstore-traces`): frontend \"executing api route /api/checkout\" span recorded `13 INTERNAL: failed to charge card ... Payment request failed. Invalid token. demo.user_context.loyalty_level=gold` from checkout `PlaceOrder` → payment `Charge` (span ERROR at charge.js:47) — the simulated `paymentFailure` decline. Unrelated concurrent anomalies: `productCatalogFailure` on (`OLJCESPC7Z` → \"failed to prepare order\", `GET /api/products/OLJCESPC7Z` and `GET /api/cart` 500) and intermittent `/api/recommendations` 500s. Root cause: the checkout API route never caught placeOrder errors, and the shared request helper never checked `response.ok`.\n\n**Fix (frontend only):**\n- `utils/Request.ts`: rejects non-success responses with a `RequestError` (status/code/payload); preserves JSON `{error, code}` messages; safely falls back to a generic message for non-JSON/empty/malformed bodies.\n- `pages/api/checkout.ts`: payment declines → HTTP 422 with client-safe `{error, code: \"PAYMENT_FAILED\"}`; unrelated internal failures → generic HTTP 500 JSON `{error: \"Internal server error\"}` with no code or upstream details; both record the exception and ERROR status on the active span so telemetry keeps the failure visible; 200 success path unchanged.\n- New focused spec `cypress/e2e/CheckoutFailure.cy.ts`. No Docker/Compose/env/flag files touched; flags were only observed.\n\n**Verification (actual):** Redeployed successfully via the benchmark tool. Final live Cypress run: 3/3 passing — 422 PAYMENT_FAILED decline (real browser checkout), generic 500 JSON for the non-payment internal failure (no PAYMENT_FAILED, no leaks), and safe non-JSON (502 HTML) handling with the page still rendering. Post-fix Jaeger traces show the 422 with the recorded payment exception (failure still fully in telemetry). Pre-existing specs: 4/7 pass; the 3 failures (cart-count in Checkout.cy.ts, session-recovery in Home.cy.ts, picture rendering in ProductDetail.cy.ts) are environmental/pre-existing and in untouched code. `BENCHMARK_REPORT.md` documents services, trace evidence, original failure, changes, test outcomes and limitations.\n\n**Limitations:** the controlled payment fault declines 100% of charges (20/20 declines observed), so a successful checkout (200 + navigation to `/cart/checkout/[orderId]`) could not be observed live — the success path is unchanged by the diff and verified by code review only. The cart page also does not render a user-facing error for a rejected placeOrder (out of scope this phase).",
